  "description": "Towing Hitch Steps Compatible with Truck/Car/SUV Vehicles with 2\" Hitch Receiver. These steep step bars also help prevent paint scratches on the back of your car. They protect your vehicle from the debris that get kicked up when driving on rough terrain，and has better collision protection.\nFeatures\nExact fit. OEDRO hitch pedals are compatible with all 2\" hitch receivers; the unique pedal design enhances the vehicle's functional appearance and provides a convenient storage area.\nUpgrade materials. OEDRO hook step adopts upgraded aluminum alloy double black coating and a stainless steel silver texture panel; this product has anti-slip, anti-rust, anti-ultraviolet, anti-collision, and other characteristics.\nSufficient load capacity. Constructed of black aluminum alloy steel tubing and thick silver textured panels, OEDRO hook steps create a 6.5\" wide step area; holds up to 350 lbs.\nSimple Installation. OEDRO Hook Steps allow for a simple bolt-on installation in 15 minutes; no drilling or cutting is required; simply slide in the receiver, then the hook pin, and finally apply and tighten the anti-shake mounting plate.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with Truck/Car/SUV Vehicles with 2\" Hitch Receiver.",
